 "ihrig_statement": "Ihrig & Golubitsky (Physica D 13 (1984) 1-33, Thm 4.2(B)): for steady-state bifurcation on an absolutely irreducible representation with nonzero quadratic equivariants, the branches given by the Equivariant Branching Lemma (axial; hypothesis H4) are generically unstable near the bifurcation point; Chossat, Lauterbach & Melbourne removed the axial restriction (as summarised by Arjevani & Field, arXiv:2107.02422). It is a stability statement. It does not say that every branch is transcritical; that is decided per axis by the restriction of the quadratic equivariant (here the gradient of I3) to Fix(Sigma).",
